OL,3,GNEWSARoyalist 17th Century locket
OL,4,Adeclared treasure
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Shropshire metal detectorist Chris
OL,7,FLangston heard the tell-tale beep of
OL,8,Fhis device in a field outside Oswestry
OL,9,Flast year, he thought it was nothing
OL,10,Funusual.
OL,12,FIt had picked up a small, heart-shaped
OL,13,Fobject that he thought could have come
OL,14,Foff horse tack and fallen into the
OL,15,Fground.
OL,17,FHowever, on closer inspection Langston
OL,18,Fnoticed there was an engraving of a
OL,19,Fheart with two arrows piercing it and a
OL,20,Fsingle drop of blood underneath, and
OL,21,Frealised it could actually be something
OL,22,Fspecial.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
