OL,3,GNEWSARoyalist 17th Century locket
OL,4,Adeclared treasure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA year later, it has been declared as
OL,7,Ftreasure and will go on display at a
OL,8,Fmuseum, where he said an official told
OL,9,Fhim it looks like "a memento mori
OL,10,Flocket to commemorate the death... of
OL,11,FCharles I in 1649.".
